{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-1-e14","title":"俭钦自将五六万众渡淮西至项","order":5508,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-1-e14","label":"正文","text":"俭钦自将五六万众渡淮西至项","evidence":["wgc-q0226","wgc-q0018"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0048","role":"自将五六万众渡淮、西至项、坚守","evidence":["wgc-q0226","wgc-q0018"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0074","role":"在外为游兵","evidence":["wgc-q0226","wgc-q0018"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0226","wgc-q0018"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0226"}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0048","name":"毌丘俭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0074","name":"文钦","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0018","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-8c475e54b34bd0181952","layer":"original","quote":"正元二年正月，有彗星数十丈，西北竟天〖17〗，起于吴、楚之分〖18〗。俭、钦喜，以为己祥〖19〗。遂矫太后诏〖20〗，罪状大将军司马景王〖21〗，移诸郡国，举兵反。迫胁淮南将守诸别屯者，及吏民大小，皆入寿春城；为坛于城西，歃血称兵为盟〖22〗，分老弱守城，俭、钦自将五六万众渡淮；西至项。俭坚守，钦在外为游兵〖23〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0226","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-8c475e54b34bd0181952","layer":"original","quote":"分老弱守城，俭、钦自将五六万众渡淮；西至项。俭坚守，钦在外为游兵","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":122,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
